  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  panel: {fileID: 651894516}
  title: Punch Whistle
  description: This 19th-century whistle is made from white metal and shaped as Punch,
    the well-known comic character associated with British Punch and Judy performances.
    Although small and decorative, it was also designed to produce a clear, piercing
    whistle. Its combination of sound and playful figurative design reflects the
    popular entertainment culture of the period.
