  panel: {fileID: 651894516}
  title: Domino
  description: This small ivory domino dates from the late 18th to early 19th century.
    Its value is marked by recessed circular pips on either side of the central dividing
    line. Dominoes were popular pieces for social tabletop games, and their hard
    ivory surfaces produced a distinctive click when placed or moved across a wooden
    table.
